  "verseCount": 8,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "39",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 39"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "39",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joote moa Babulon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kindeno Marduk-Baladan wuod Baladan ruodh Babulon nooro joote ir Hezekia gi barupe kod mich nikech yande nowinjo ni otuo to koro osechango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia norwako joote gi mor mi onyisogi gik duto mane nitiere utege mag keno kaka fedha, dhahabu, gik mangʼwe ngʼar kod modhi ma nengogi tek kaachiel gi kar kenone mar gige lweny duto kod gik moko duto mane yudore kuom mwandune. Onge gimoro amora mane odongʼ e ode kata e pinye duto mane ok onyisogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Isaya janabi nodhi ir Ruoth Hezekia mopenje niya, \"Angʼo mane jogo owacho kendo negia kanye?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ISA 39:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia nodwoke niya, \"Negia e piny mabor, miluongo ni Babulon.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Janabi nopenjo niya, \"Angʼo mane gineno e odi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "ISA 39:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekia nodwoke niya, \"Giseneno gik moko duto manie oda. Onge gimoro amora modongʼ e mwanduna mane ok anyisogi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Isaya nowachone Hezekia niya, \"Wach Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho kama:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalo biro chopo adier ma gik moko duto manie odi kod gik moko mane kwereni osekano nyaka chil kawuono, noter Babulon. Onge gimoro amora mane odongʼ, Jehova Nyasaye owacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kendo nyikwayi moko mowuok e ringri kendo rembi iwuon noter e twech mi nolokgi wasumbini mabwoch e od ruoth mar ruodh Babulon.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia nodwoke niya, \"Wach Jehova Nyasaye misewacho ber.\" Nodwoke kamano koparo niya, \"Abiro bedo gi kwe kod rit makare e ndalo mar ngimana.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
